{"type":"text","timestamp":1787409893009,"sessionID":"ses_fd6154108ffeGObv2Snb2Ve532","part":{"id":"prt_029ee7bf8001u1HUGk1Zax7f8P","messageID":"msg_029ee690e001G9f1Eab4pT1itf","sessionID":"ses_fd6154108ffeGObv2Snb2Ve532","type":"text","text":"The range.test.js failures are pre-existing and unrelated to `diff` (they're about range hyphen-parsing, and `diff.js` isn't exercised by that file). My change to `functions/diff.js` is complete and all diff requirements pass.

Summary of the fix in `functions/diff.js`:
- Identical / build-only-differing versions → `null` (via `compare() === 0`).
